<h3>7. Administrative assistant</h3>
<p><strong>What you do:</strong> answer phones, schedule appointments, manage files and email, order supplies and keep an office running smoothly.</p>
<p><strong>Typical requirements:</strong> comfort with email, spreadsheets and word processing; strong organization. Some employers prefer prior office experience, but many entry-level roles train the right person.</p>
